Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In addition to the licensing changes above, nomploy adds first-class support
for deploying to HashiCorp Nomad (compose-to-HCL translation, a Nomad cluster
dashboard, per-server Nomad configuration, and related setup), and rebrands the
project as "nomploy".

